      {q:"Who is the best knee replacement surgeon in Ahmedabad?", a:"At DHS Multispecialty Hospital our knee replacement programme is led by Dr. Hardik M Shah (Medical Director, MS Orthopedic, FRCS Germany) and Dr. Swagat M Shah (MS Ortho, DNB Ortho, FIAAS UK). Together they lead a DHS team that has successfully performed 2,000+ knee replacement surgeries (robotic and conventional) with high patient satisfaction."},
